 "answer": "CD-10403: Re: Subscription Charge Refund Request\n\nDear Customer,\n\nThank you for reaching out regarding your recent subscription charge. We understand that you have concerns about receiving a refund for the charge you received on October 23, 2026.\n\nAccording to our policy, subscriptions charges can be fully refunded if the refund request is submitted within 30 days of the charge date. In your case, since the charge was made 12 days ago, it falls within the eligibility window.\n\nWe have initiated the process to request a full refund from Billing. This refund should reach your original payment method within approximately 5 to 10 business days.\n\nPlease note that due to the nature of our billing system, there may be a slight delay before the refund is",
